---
title: Sent Mail Deleted Shortly After Bulk Send From Corporate Mailbox
id: 8f1c1a2e-4b3d-4e7a-9c2f-1a2b3c4d5e05
status: experimental
description: Detects a burst of outbound email followed by deletion from the Sent folder within a short window, matching UNC6040's reported lateral phishing and trail-covering behavior via a compromised mailbox.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://thehackernews.com/2025/06/google-exposes-vishing-group-unc6040.html
tags:
    - attack.lateral_movement
    - attack.defense_evasion
    - attack.t1566.004
logsource:
    category: application
    product: m365
    service: exchange
detection:
    selection_send:
        Operation: 'Send'
    selection_delete:
        Operation:
            - 'SoftDelete'
            - 'HardDelete'
        Folder: 'Sent Items'
    timeframe: 30m
    condition: selection_send | count() by UserId > 15 and selection_delete
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate mailbox cleanup or retention policy execution
level: high

---
title: Rapid-Deadline Extortion Email Referencing Stolen CRM Data
id: 8f1c1a2e-4b3d-4e7a-9c2f-1a2b3c4d5e06
status: experimental
description: Detects inbound email content consistent with the ShinyHunters/UNC6240 extortion handoff following a UNC6040 intrusion, typically citing a short payment deadline.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://thehackernews.com/2026/01/mandiant-finds-shinyhunters-using.html
tags:
    - attack.impact
    - attack.t1657
logsource:
    category: email
    service: gateway
detection:
    selection:
        Subject|contains:
            - 'data breach'
            - 'stolen data'
            - 'ransom'
        Body|contains:
            - '72 hour'
            - '72-hour'
            - 'payment deadline'
    condition: selection
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate breach-notification or security vendor correspondence
level: medium
